---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { PHONE_DISPLAY, PHONE_TEL, SITE_TITLE } from "../../consts";
---

<section id="emergency" class="bg-accent text-white scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="reveal-group container py-14 md:py-16 text-center max-w-3xl">
    <Icon name="lucide:triangle-alert" size={40} class="reveal-scale mx-auto mb-4" />
    <h2 class="reveal text-white">
      <span data-i18n="en">24/7 Emergency Drain &amp; Plumbing Service</span>
      <span data-i18n="es" style="display:none">Servicio de Emergencia de Drenaje y Plomería 24/7</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal text-white/90 mb-8">
      <span data-i18n="en">Drain and plumbing problems can happen at any time. If you have a clogged drain, sewer backup, slow drainage, water issue, or urgent plumbing problem, call {SITE_TITLE} for emergency service.</span>
      <span data-i18n="es" style="display:none">Los problemas de drenaje y plomería pueden pasar en cualquier momento. Si tienes un drenaje tapado, backup de sewer, drenaje lento, problema de agua o una emergencia de plomería, llama a {SITE_TITLE}.</span>
    </p>
    <a href={PHONE_TEL} class="reveal btn bg-white text-accent rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition h-auto py-3 px-6">
      <Icon name="lucide:phone-call" size={18} />
      <span data-i18n="en">Call Now</span>
      <span data-i18n="es" style="display:none">Llamar Ahora</span>
      <span>— {PHONE_DISPLAY}</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
